Preamble
The Swiss Federal Council,
on the basis of Articles 15a paragraph 1, 15b paragraph 6, 15c paragraph 2 and 95 of the Railways Act of 20 December 1957 (RailA), on Article 14 paragraph 3 of the Goods Carriage Act of 25 September 2015, on Article 5 paragraphs 1 and 2 of the Navigation Act of 23 September 1953and on Articles 25 paragraphs 1 and 4, 26 paragraph 6 and 26a paragraph 1 of the Civil Aviation Act of 21 December 1948 (CAA), in implementation of Regulation (EU) No 996/2010 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 and Directive (EU) 2016/798,
ordains:
